# VideoBrief — UI verification

After any change that affects user-visible UI (pages, forms, layouts, components, i18n copy on screens):

1. Ensure `pnpm dev` is running (or start it).
2. Use **Cursor browser tools** against `http://localhost:3000`.
3. Exercise the real flow (navigate, snapshot, click/type as needed). Screenshot when layout matters.
4. Do **not** treat `pnpm test` / type-check alone as UI verification.
5. Do **not** add Playwright for this — browser tools only.

Mechanical stop hooks only cover type-check / lint / test. Browser checks are your responsibility before ending the turn.

Canonical note also lives in `AGENTS.md` → “UI verification”.
